Wetonan tulis: (['a:b:'] - [':']), baris-anyar.
Wetonan tulis: (['Lorem Ipsum'] - ['Ipsum']), baris-anyar.
Wetonan tulis: (['a.................b.......................c...........'] - ['.']), baris-anyar.
Wetonan tulis: (['a--b--c---d'] - ['--']), baris-anyar.
Wetonan tulis: (['-'] - ['--']), baris-anyar.
Wetonan tulis: ([''] - ['--']), baris-anyar.
Wetonan tulis: (['--'] - ['']), baris-anyar.
Wetonan tulis: ([''] - ['']), baris-anyar.
>> x := ['xx'].
>> y := x - ['x'].
Wetonan tulis: x, baris-anyar.
Wetonan tulis: y, baris-anyar.
>> x := ['a,bb,c'].
>> y := x ganti: [''] nganggo: ['xx'].
Wetonan tulis: ((x padha-karo: y) pilih: ['OK'] utawa: ['BUG! Did return a copy by accident!']), baris-anyar.